    "text": "with Ada.Text_IO; use Ada.Text_IO;\n\nprocedure Show_Rendezvous is\n\n   task T is\n      entry Start;\n   end T;\n\n   task body T is\n   begin\n      accept Start;\n      --     ^ Waiting for somebody\n      --       to call the entry\n\n      Put_Line (\"In T\");\n   end T;\n\nbegin\n   Put_Line (\"In Main\");\n\n   --  Calling T's entry:\n   T.Start;\nend Show_Rendezvous;\n",
